OL,3,GNEWSAThousands attend city's Christmas 
OL,4,Alights switch-on                       
OL,6,FThousands of people gathered to watch a
OL,7,Fcity switch on its festive lights.     
OL,9,FEntertainment, including live music,   
OL,10,Ffilled Cathedral Square in Peterborough
OL,11,Ffrom about 17:00 GMT on Friday.        
OL,13,FLow-noise fireworks were also set off  
OL,14,Fto fill the city sky with more light.  
OL,16,FThe event was livestreamed on the city 
OL,17,Fcouncil's Facebook page.               
